# doi:10.3891/acta.chem.scand.19-0079; COD 1539529 (CC0):
# https://www.crystallography.net/cod/1539529.cif
# The source asymmetric sites are expanded explicitly in P1. This historical
# model is provisional: later refinements report corrected pseudo-centres and
# somewhat different cell parameters, but no comparably redistributable modern
# CIF was identified. Low-temperature superstructures are outside scope.
# The catalog B_ang2=0.6 A^2 is a modeling placeholder, not source-derived.
# Limiting checks: Re4Se8, source triclinic volume, finite basal (001) coupling.
# Validation: rese2-cod1539529-structure
